  "notes": [
    "Nintendo JP Wii controllers page, spec modal classicProDetail.html, product code [RVL-005(-02)]. Axis mapping as labelled: 縦 100.5mm = height, 横 146mm = width, 厚さ 55mm = depth, 突起部分を除く → excludes_projections true. 操作部 lists the same buttons as the Classic Controller (a, b, 十字, X, Y, L, R, ZR, ZL; L/R sticks; −/Select, Home, +/Start) → dpad 1, face_button 4, bumper 2 + trigger 2 (L/R and ZL/ZR; unlike the original, only the sticks are analogue here), stick 2, button 3. Which pair is the shoulder and which the grip trigger is not stated on the page; the counts do not depend on it. Wii Classic Controllers attach to the Wii Remote's extension connector (「Wiiリモコン、Wiiリモコンプラスの通信機能を利用」); the cord to the Remote is not described on the page, so wired, ports and cable_length_mm stay null/[]. No battery mentioned (cell_kind null). Mass not published. released from the controllers page alt text."
